    "title": "Gartner warns $3.5 trillion in AI infrastructure spending faces write-down risk by 2030",
    "summary": "AI infrastructure investments risk significant financial losses, prompting potential market consolidation and strategic reevaluation by 2030.\nThe post Gartner warns $3.5 trillion in AI infrastructure spending faces write-down risk by 2030 appeared first on Crypto Briefing.",
    "hasSummary": true,
    "link": "https://cryptobriefing.com/gartner-ai-infrastructure-write-down-risk/",
    "source": "CryptoBriefing",
